# .dockerignore for the commit-image build (`docker build -f mayhem/Dockerfile .`).
#
# BuildKit gives `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore` full PRECEDENCE over the context-root
# .dockerignore, so this file is what applies to our build. oxc ships no root .dockerignore today,
# but pinning our own keeps the context deterministic if upstream later adds one tuned for its own
# release images (see docs/netnew-worker-prompt.md §4b on silent oracle collapse).
#
# Goal: bake in the FULL repo INCLUDING .git history (SPEC §6.2 item 2 — the grader and the PATCH
# tier read it), dropping ONLY build outputs and local cruft. This is a dev image, not a minimal
# one.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded, though it may look like cruft: oxc TRACKS fixture files under
# `**/node_modules/` and `**/dist/` (apps/oxlint/test/fixtures/load_paths/node_modules/…,
# apps/oxfmt/test/cli/…/dist/…). A blanket node_modules/dist ignore would silently delete
# committed test data from the image. `target/` is the only cargo output dir and oxc tracks
# nothing under it (verified with `git ls-files`).

# ── cargo build outputs (regenerated by mayhem/build.sh) ─────────────────────
/target/
**/target/

# ── local cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/

# ── editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
